1. Containerization (Docker)
Aasan Analogy: "Tiffin Box"
Pehle jab aap kisi ke computer par code run karte the, toh bolna padta tha: "Bhai pehle Node.js v20 download karo, Python dalo, dependencies dalo, environment variables set karo..."
Aur aksar sunne ko milta tha: "Mere laptop pe toh chal raha tha, par server pe error de raha hai!" (The classic "It works on my machine" problem).

Docker is problem ko khatam karta hai: Yeh aapke pure code, libraries, Node.js version aur settings ko ek compact "Container (Dabbe)" me seal pack kar deta hai. Ab chahe wo aapka Windows PC ho, Mac ho ya Linux VPS server — wo container har jagah 100% same chalega!

