Code Me Kya Ho Raha Hai? (frontend/nginx.conf)
nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    root /usr/share/nginx/html;
    index index.html;
    # 1. React SPA Refresh Fix (Sabse important!)
    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
    }
    # 2. Static Assets Caching (Speed 10x!)
    location ~* \.(js|css|png|jpg|svg|woff2)$ {
        expires 1y;
        add_header Cache-Control "public, immutable";
    }
    # 3. Gzip Compression (Bandwidth savings)
    gzip on;
}
Kya Problem Solve Ki?
The Classic React 404 Refresh Bug: React Single Page App (SPA) me jab aap /eligibility-calculator par page refresh karte hain, toh traditional web servers 404 error de dete hain kyunki unke paas waisi HTML file nahi hoti. Nginx ka try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html; har route ko smoothly React ke paas bhej deta hai.
Super Fast Loading: Images aur JS files ko 1 saal ke liye browser cache me save karata hai aur Gzip compression se file size 70% compress kar deta hai.
Interview Question & Answer:
Interviewer: "Why not serve React static files directly from Node.js Express? Why use Nginx?"
Your Answer: "Node.js single-threaded event loop par chalta hai. Agar wo static files (images, css, js) serve karne lagega, toh API requests slow ho jayengi. Nginx C-language based asynchronous event-driven server hai jo static files ko Node.js se 10 guna zyada speed aur negligible memory ke sath serve karta hai."

3. Zero-Downtime Deployment (Coolify / Webhooks)
Aasan Analogy: "Running Relay Race"
Sochiye ek running train chal rahi hai aur uske purane engine ko naye engine se replace karna hai bina train roke!

Pehle kya hota tha:

Naya code deploy karte waqt server band (stop) kiya jata tha ➔ naya code dala jata tha ➔ server start hota tha.
Is 2-3 minute ke dauran jo bhi student website par aata tha, use "502 Bad Gateway" ya "Server Down" error dikhti thi.
Humare Project Me Kahan Hai?


.github/workflows/ci.yml
 (Line 89 to 105)
VPS Coolify Dashboard (Webhook integration)
Kaise Kaam Karta Hai?
GitHub Actions ke saare tests pass hone par ek secret webhook hit hota hai:
curl -X GET $COOLIFY_DEPLOY_WEBHOOK
Coolify VPS par naya Docker container background me start karta hai.
Wo check karta hai: "Kya naya container healthy hai aur port 5000 par respond kar raha hai?"
Jaise hi naya container Ready (Green) hota hai, Nginx traffic ko turant naye container par shift kar deta hai, aur phir purane container ko band karta hai.
Result: Website 1 second ke liye bhi band nahi hoti!
Interview Question & Answer:
Interviewer: "How do you ensure zero-downtime during deployments?"
Your Answer: "We use a Rolling / Blue-Green deployment strategy managed by Docker and Coolify. When the CI pipeline triggers the deployment webhook, the orchestrator spawns the new container version alongside the old one. Traffic is only shifted via the reverse proxy once the health-check endpoint (/api/health) returns HTTP 200. Only after verification is the old container gracefully decommissioned."

4. Database Disaster Recovery (Backup & Restore)
Aasan Analogy: "Insurance & Safe Locker"
Sochiye server ki hard disk crash ho gayi, ya kisi ne galti se leads ka database drop kar diya, ya ransomware attack ho gaya. Agar backup na ho, toh saare students ka data hamesha ke liye gayab!

Humare Project Me Kahan Hai?


db_backup/import_on_vps.sh


backend/scripts/backupDb.js


VPS_DATABASE_SETUP_GUIDE.md
Kaise Kaam Karta Hai? (import_on_vps.sh)
bash
# 1. Compressed BSON data ko extract karta hai
tar -xzf /tmp/unicoach_backup.tar.gz -C /tmp/
# 2. Database restore command
mongorestore \
  --uri="$MONGO_URI" \
  --dir="$BACKUP_DIR/unicoach" \
  --gzip \
  --drop
# 3. Automatic Verification (Check karta hai count sahi hai ya nahi)
mongosh "$MONGO_URI" --eval "
  print('Universities: ' + db.universities.countDocuments());
  print('Scholarships: ' + db.scholarships.countDocuments());
  print('Users: ' + db.users.countDocuments());
"
Kya Problem Solve Ki?
1-Click Server Migration: Local computer ka pura database (Universities, Cutoffs, Scholarships, Leads) 1 single command se VPS cloud database par copy ho jata hai.
Data Safety: Roz raat ko compressed .tar.gz backup banaya jata hai jisse kisi bhi disaster ke waqt 5 minute ke andar pura system restore kiya ja sake.
Interview Question & Answer:
Interviewer: "How do you handle database migration and disaster recovery in production?"
Your Answer: "We automated MongoDB migration and backups using native binary tools (mongodump and mongorestore with --gzip compression). Our migration shell script (import_on_vps.sh) extracts the backup archive, restores all indexed collections atomically with --drop, and immediately executes an automated verification query via mongosh to assert document count integrity."

Quick Review Summary:
Docker: Laptop aur Server ke beech ka environment gap khatam karta hai.
Nginx: Security, Caching, aur React routing sambhalta hai.
Zero-Downtime: Bina kisi downtime ke 24/7 site ko live update karta hai.
Disaster Recovery: Kisi bhi crash ke waqt data ko 100% surakshit rakhta hai.
