Matlab:
EXPOSE 80: Web browser se aane wale standard HTTP traffic ke liye Port 80 open rakho.
CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]: Nginx ko Foreground (Main screen) par chalao.
Kyun? Docker ka rule hai: agar container ke andar chalne wala main process background me chala gaya, toh Docker sochega kaam khatam aur container turant OFF (Exit) ho jayega! daemon off; Nginx ko 24/7 zinda rakhta hai.
3 Killer Points Jo Interview Me Bolne Hain:
Agar interviewer puche: "Explain your Dockerfile architecture for React/Vite", toh ye 3 points bolna:

Security: Production container me koi npm, koi node, aur koi source code (raw JSX/TS) nahi hota. Agar koi hacker container hack bhi kar le, toh use koi source code ya build tools nahi milenge.
Speed & Bandwidth: 1.2 GB ki jagah sirf 30 MB ki image banti hai, jo cloud server par 5 second me download aur deploy ho jati hai.
Docker Layer Caching: package.json ko source code se alag copy karke humne build pipeline ko 10x fast kiya hai.



